          "block": "method",
          "code": "flowchart LR\n  A[Sample candidate plans] --> B[Score with critic]\n  B --> C{Above threshold?}\n  C -- yes --> D[Expand branch]\n  C -- no --> E[Prune]\n  D --> B"
